1
00:00:01,890 --> 00:00:04,830
Before you log in, the gear on the login screen opens Settings.

2
00:00:04,930 --> 00:00:09,060
Language sets the language of the app.

3
00:00:09,160 --> 00:00:16,000
Entries lets you add a server your broker gave you: a name, its address and its DB alias.

4
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:19,720
Click Add, and the entry is listed below.

5
00:00:19,820 --> 00:00:23,140
The cross removes an entry again.

6
00:00:23,240 --> 00:00:25,900
Click Save to close Settings and go back to the login screen.

